iv class=\"spec type anchored\" id=\"type-ty\"><a href=\"#type-ty\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">type</span> <span>'ghost ty</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Extension types; appear in svalue types through <code>TExtension</code>.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-equal_ty\"><a href=\"#val-equal_ty\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> equal_ty : \u000A  <span><span>(<span><span class=\"type-var\">'ghost</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span class=\"type-var\">'ghost</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Ppx_deriving_runtime</span>.bool)</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span><span class=\"type-var\">'ghost</span> <a href=\"#type-ty\">ty</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span><span class=\"type-var\">'ghost</span> <a href=\"#type-ty\">ty</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Ppx_deriving_runtime</span>.bool</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-compare_ty\"><a href=\"#val-compare_ty\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> compare_ty : \u000A  <span><span>(<span><span class=\"type-var\">'ghost</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span class=\"type-var\">'ghost</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Ppx_deriving_runtime</span>.int)</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span><span class=\"type-var\">'ghost</span> <a href=\"#type-ty\">ty</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span><span class=\"type-var\">'ghost</span> <a href=\"#type-ty\">ty</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Ppx_deriving_runtime</span>.int</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec type subst anchored\" id=\"type-super_ty\"><a href=\"#type-super_ty\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">type</span> <span>'g super_ty</span></span><span> := <span><span><span class=\"type-var\">'g</span> <a href=\"#type-ty\">ty</a></span> <a href=\"../../../Svalue/index.html#type-ty\">Bv_values.Svalue.ty</a></span></span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec type subst anchored\" id=\"type-super_t\"><a href=\"#type-super_t\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">type</span> <span>'g super_t</span></span><span> := <span><span>(<span class=\"type-var\">'g</span>, <span><span class=\"type-var\">'g</span> <a href=\"#type-t\">t</a></span>, <span><span class=\"type-var\">'g</span> <a href=\"#type-ty\">ty</a></span>)</span> <a href=\"../../../Svalue/index.html#type-t\">Bv_values.Svalue.t</a></span></span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-pp\"><a href=\"#val-pp\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> pp : <span><span><span><span class=\"type-var\">'g</span> <a href=\"#type-super_t\">super_t</a></span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Fmt</span>.t</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span><span class=\"type-var\">'g</span> <a href=\"#type-t\">t</a></span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Fmt</span>.t</span></span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-pp_ty\"><a href=\"#val-pp_ty\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> pp_ty : <span><span><span class=\"type-var\">'g</span> <a href=\"#type-ty\">ty</a></span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Fmt</span>.t</span></span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-iter_vars\"><a href=\"#val-iter_vars\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> iter_vars : <span><span>(<span><span><span class=\"type-var\">'g</span> <a href=\"#type-super_t\">super_t</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> unit)</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span><span class=\"type-var\">'g</span> <a href=\"#type-t\">t</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> unit</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-hash\"><a href=\"#val-hash\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> hash : <span><span><span class=\"type-var\">'g</span> <a href=\"#type-t\">t</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> int</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-hash_ty\"><a href=\"#val-hash_ty\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> hash_ty : <span><span><span class=\"type-var\">'g</span> <a href=\"#type-ty\">ty</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> int</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-mk\"><a href=\"#val-mk\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> mk : \u000A  <span><span>(<span><span><span>(<span class=\"type-var\">'g</span>, <span><span class=\"type-var\">'g</span> <a href=\"#type-t\">t</a></span>, <span><span class=\"type-var\">'g</span> <a href=\"#type-ty\">ty</a></span>)</span> <a href=\"../../../Svalue/index.html#type-t_kind\">Bv_values.Svalue.t_kind</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span><span class=\"type-var\">'g</span> <a href=\"#type-super_ty\">super_ty</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span class=\"type-var\">'g</span> <a href=\"#type-super_t\">super_t</a></span>)</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span><span class=\"type-var\">'g</span> <a href=\"#type-super_ty\">super_ty</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span><span class=\"type-var\">'g</span> <a href=\"#type-t\">t</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"type-var\">'g</span> <a href=\"#type-super_t\">super_t</a></span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>mk build ty x</code> is the value representing extension value <code>x</code> at type <code>ty</code> — typically <code>build (Extension x) ty</code>, but the extension may normalise to a different svalue for simplifications.</p><p><code>build</code> hash-conses a node kind at a type in the embedding <a href=\"../../../Svalue/Make/index.html\" title=\"Soteria.Bv_values.Svalue.Make\"><code>Make</code></a> application. It is provided as a helper.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-eval\"><a href=\"#val-eval\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> eval : <span><span>(<span><span><span class=\"type-var\">'g</span> <a href=\"#type-super_t\">super_t</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span class=\"type-var\">'g</span> <a href=\"#type-super_t\">super_t</a></span>)</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span><span class=\"type-var\">'g</span> <a href=\"#type-t\">t</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span class=\"type-var\">'g</span> <a href=\"#type-t\">t</a></span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>eval eval_super x</code> returns <code>x</code> with every enclosing svalue nested in it replaced by <code>eval_super</code> applied to it. This should <b>not</b> attempt to re-apply smart constructors: if the returned value is not physically equal to the input, <a href=\"#val-mk\"><code>mk</code></a> will be applied to it, at which point smart constructors are used.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-apply_subst\"><a href=\"#val-apply_subst\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> apply_subst : \u000A  <span><span>(<span><span class=\"label\">missing_var</span>:<span>(<span><a href=\"../../../../Symex/Var/index.html#type-t\">Soteria.Symex.Var.t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span><span class=\"type-var\">'g</span> <a href=\"#type-super_ty\">super_ty</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span class=\"type-var\">'g</span> <a href=\"#type-super_t\">super_t</a></span>)</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A    <span><span class=\"type-var\">'subst</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A    <span><span><span class=\"type-var\">'g</span> <a href=\"#type-super_t\">super_t</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A    <span><span class=\"type-var\">'g</span> <a href=\"#type-super_t\">super_t</a></span> * <span class=\"type-var\">'subst</span>)</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">missing_var</span>:<span>(<span><a href=\"../../../../Symex/Var/index.html#type-t\">Soteria.Symex.Var.t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span><span class=\"type-var\">'g</span> <a href=\"#type-super_ty\">super_ty</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span class=\"type-var\">'g</span> <a href=\"#type-super_t\">super_t</a></span>)</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"type-var\">'subst</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span><span class=\"type-var\">'g</span> <a href=\"#type-t\">t</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"type-var\">'g</span> <a href=\"#type-t\">t</a></span> * <span class=\"type-var\">'subst</span></span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-encode_ty\"><a href=\"#val-encode_ty\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> encode_ty : <span><span>(<span><span><span class=\"type-var\">'g</span> <a href=\"#type-super_ty\">super_ty</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <a href=\"../../../../Smt/index.html#type-sexp\">Smt.sexp</a>)</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span><span class=\"type-var\">'g</span> <a href=\"#type-ty\">ty</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <a href=\"../../../../Smt/index.html#type-sexp\">Smt.sexp</a></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>encode_ty encode_ty ty</code> is the SMT-LIB sort representing <code>ty</code>; <code>encode_ty</code> encodes the types nested inside it. The encoder may use <a href=\"../../../../Solvers/Decls/index.html#val-declare\" title=\"Soteria.Solvers.Decls.declare\"><code>Solvers.Decls.declare</code></a> to introduce auxiliary declarations (e.g. algebraic datatypes) its encoding relies on.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-encode_value\"><a href=\"#val-encode_value\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> encode_value : \u000A  <span><span>(<span><span><span class=\"type-var\">'g</span> <a href=\"#type-super_ty\">super_ty</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <a href=\"../../../../Smt/index.html#type-sexp\">Smt.sexp</a>)</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span>(<span><span><span class=\"type-var\">'g</span> <a href=\"#type-super_t\">super_t</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <a href=\"../../../../Smt/index.html#type-sexp\">Smt.sexp</a>)</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">ty</span>:<span><span class=\"type-var\">'g</span> <a href=\"#type-super_ty\">super_ty</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span><span class=\"type-var\">'g</span> <a href=\"#type-t\">t</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <a href=\"../../../../Smt/index.html#type-sexp\">Smt.sexp</a></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>encode_value encode_ty encode ~ty x</code> is the SMT-LIB term representing extension value <code>x</code>, where <code>ty</code> is the type of the svalue whose kind is <code>Extension x</code>; <code>encode_ty</code> (resp. <code>encode</code>) encodes nested types (resp. values). Like <a href=\"#val-encode_ty\"><code>encode_ty</code></a>, may call <a href=\"../../../../Solvers/Decls/index.html#val-declare\" title=\"Soteria.Solvers.Decls.declare\"><code>Solvers.Decls.declare</code></a>.</p></div></div>"}